      "content": "The new results do not reach replay session figures: `replay-series.ts` builds them through an explicit `figuresOf()` projection that copies neither `rewardRiskOdds` nor `extremes`. Consequently every replay session still exposes these as undefined, despite A268 requiring the weight in session figures (and ReplayFigures already declaring both fields). Update that projection and add a replay-level regression test.",
