    {
      "path": "src/domain/trade-analysis/evaluate.ts",
      "content": "This omits `extremes` for a confirmed Plan before its first execution, including replay cutoffs before entry. Such states are supported by derive/evaluate, but A268 defines the weight from the Plan and fixes it for the Trade's life. A long-stock or long-option Plan therefore has no weight until entry (and consumers using the documented missing-value fallback treat it as Main rather than Remote). Carry the classification from the frozen Plan into the derived state instead of depending on an execution, and test a pre-entry evaluation.",
